        <rule name="Firepoints" id="b8f8-3c37-cb87-b623" hidden="false">
          <description>The Chimera is fitted with six hull lasguns for passengers to use. Up to six passengers can use them to fire at single target. Additionally, one model may fire a weapon from the top hatch using their own weapon, but doing so turns the Chimera into an open topped vehicle until the next turn.</description>
