            <selectionEntry id="c61ddc81-2834-f152-ede0-335ca4d1b583-2d6b9" name="Finest Hour" hidden="false" collective="false" type="upgrade">
              <profiles />
              <rules>
                <rule id="8a4ad346-8015-f590-2c9c-390d3cf691ed-2d6b9" name="Finest Hour" hidden="false">
                  <profiles />
                  <rules />
                  <infoLinks />
                  <modifiers />
                  <description>Once per game, at the start of any of their turns, a player may choose to take his Warlord's Finest Hour.
The warlord has a 3++ and Eternal Warrior and is allowed to order an All-out Attack.
Furthermore you may roll on the Exemplar Tables or use the Sons of the Primarch-rule.
These effects last until the Warlord's next turn.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <infoLinks />
              <modifiers />
